╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│▸ Usage:                                                                             │
│  otter create --init --nvidia --root                                                │
│  otter create --clone my-box --name my-copy                                         │
│  otter create --image alpine --name my-alpinebox                                    │
│  otter create --init --additional-flags "--pids-limit 100"                          │
│  otter create --init --volume /opt/my-dir:/usr/local/my-dir:rw                      │
│  otter create --image centos:stream10 --pull --home ~/otter/centos10                │
│  otter create --image alpine:latest --additional-packages "git tmux vim"            │
│  otter create --image rocky --pre-init-hooks "rpm -qa | wc -l"                      │
│  otter create --image registry.fedoraproject.org/fedora-toolbox:latest              │
│  otter create --image alpine:latest --init-hooks "touch /tmp/test1 && touch grass"  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│▸ Options:                                                                           │
│ --yes                 ┆ -Y   Non-interactive, pull images without asking            │
│ --home                ┆ -H   Custom HOME directory for the container                │
│ --init                ┆ -I   Use init system (e.g. systemd) inside the container    │
│ --name                ┆ -n   Name for the container                                 │
│ --pull                ┆ -p   Pull image even if it exists locally (implies --yes)   │
│ --root                ┆ -r   Launch container manager with root privileges          │
│ --clone               ┆ -c   Name of container to use as base for new container     │
│ --image               ┆ -i   Image to use for the container                         │
│ --nvidia                     Integrate host's Nvidia drivers into container         │
│ --volume                     Additional volumes to add to the container             │
│ --hostname                   Hostname for the container                             │
│ --no-entry                   Do not generate a container entry on host system       │
│ --platform                   Specify the target platform, e.g. linux/arm64          │
│ --init-hooks                 Commands to run at end of container initialization     │
│ --unshare-ipc                Do not share IPC namespace with host                   │
│ --unshare-all                Activate all unshare flags                             │
│ --unshare-netns              Do not share net namespace with host                   │
│ --pre-init-hooks             Commands to run at start of container initialization   │
│ --unshare-groups             Do not forward user's additional groups into container │
│ --unshare-devsys             Do not share host devices and sysfs dirs               │
│ --unshare-process            Do not share process namespace with host               │
│ --additional-flags    ┆ -a   Additional flags to pass to the container manager      │
│ --additional-packages ┆ -ap  Additional packages to install during container setup  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│▸ Extras:                                                                            │
│ --help    ┆ -h  Show this help message                                              │
│ --verbose ┆ -v  Show more verbose output                                            │
│ --dry-run ┆ -d   Print the generated container manager command                      │
│ --absolutely-disable-root-password-i-am-really-positively-sure                      │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│▸ Notes:                                                                             │
│ --root    Preferred over 'sudo otter' when root is needed. To use a program         │
│           other than sudo, set OTR_SUDO_PROGRAM or 'otter_sudo_program' config var. │
│                                                                                     │
│ --init    Makes host processes not visible from within the container, assumes       │
│           --unshare-process. May require additional packages depending on the image │
│           ,like systemd, runit or openrc.                                           │
│                                                                                     │
│ --clone   Useful to rename an existing container or create multiple copies of the   │
│           same container environment.                                               │
│                                                                                     │
│ --nvidia  Best effort attempt to integrate host nvidia drivers into the container.  │
│           For a better experience consider nvidia's nvidia-container-toolkit,       │
│           the official way to use nvidia cards inside containers.                   │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│▸ Compatibility:                                                                     │
│  For a list of compatible images run:                                               │
│  otter compatibility --list-images                                                  │
│  For checking system compatibiltiy run:                                             │
│  otter compatibility --system                                                       │
╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯